^{:go/end 167} (go/method lookupAndEscapeTemplate "lookupAndEscapeTemplate guarantees that the template with the given name\nis escaped, or returns an error if it cannot be. It returns the named\ntemplate.\n" [^{:tag (* Template)} t ^string name] :results [^{:tag (* Template)} tmpl ^error err]
